# 🟢 LEVEL 1 – Beginner Friendly

# What Makes Cloud Security Different?

Traditional Security

↓

Protect your own servers.

Cloud Security

↓

Protect resources running inside someone else's infrastructure.

This introduces new responsibilities like:

* Identity Management
* Cloud Storage Security
* API Security
* Virtual Networking
* Cloud Monitoring

---

# Major Cloud Platforms

```text
AWS (Amazon)

↓

Azure (Microsoft)

↓

Google Cloud (GCP)
```

Although their services have different names, many concepts are similar.

---

# Cloud Security Layers

```text
Users

↓

IAM

↓

Applications

↓

Virtual Machines

↓

Storage

↓

Networking

↓

Cloud Infrastructure
```

Security must be applied at every layer.

