# Cloud Incident Response

## Step 1

Identify Incident

↓

Example:

Unauthorized IAM user created.

---

## Step 2

Contain

↓

Disable compromised credentials.

---

## Step 3

Investigate

↓

Review logs.

Review IAM.

Review CloudTrail/Azure Monitor/Cloud Logging.

---

## Step 4

Recover

↓

Rotate credentials.

Restore secure configuration.

Patch vulnerabilities.

---

## Step 5

Lessons Learned

↓

Improve IAM.

Improve monitoring.

Improve detection rules.

